  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial_Dialogue_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 37b25b16a7f8ebd4587edf573bbd7769, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 26544250880
    m_Localized: Welcome to the amazing demo of Shuffle Circus!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1220310278144
    m_Localized: Shuffle Circus is a card game where you play pokerhands to score
      points.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4007614029824
    m_Localized: You and your opponent have three rows, each consisting of five cardslots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3170703581184
    m_Localized: First, let's talk about the rules.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4588911009792
    m_Localized: This is your discard pile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4702287241216
    m_Localized: And this is your draw pile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5143200866304
    m_Localized: Before the game starts a normal four color deck will be shuffled
      and split between you and your opponent. That means that every player has only
      half a deck.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2556735323099136
    m_Localized: You play three rounds against increasingly stronger opponents. At
      the end of each round, you receive an artifact that slightly changes the rules
      and allows you to score even more points.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2558024417267712
    m_Localized: Now let's take a look at the gameboard!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4902808526848
    m_Localized: Your opponent also has one of each.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5371631050752
    m_Localized: You may play up to four cards each turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5456712507392
    m_Localized: Place these cards on your cardslots!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5667375620096
    m_Localized: Try to build pokerhands. But only complete hands earn you points.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5771453079552
    m_Localized: They also only count if they are on the same row.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5818286678016
    m_Localized: Cards can be stolen from your opponent if your played card has the
      same symbol as theirs. This only works in the row directly opposite yours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2558893141512192
    m_Localized: But beware! You cards can be stolen too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5864709234688
    m_Localized: Cards you didn't play and stolen cards get placed in your discard
      pile at the end of your turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2559037299740672
    m_Localized: If you run out of cards, your discard pile is shuffled back into
      your deck.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2559606030585856
    m_Localized: Thems the rules! You can now enter the amazing Shuffle Circus. Have
      fun!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
